  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RHRN2 - RNW Media</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Led by Rutgers with partners across Asia and Africa, the RHRN2 consortium enables young people in all their diversity to enjoy their SRHR in gender-just societies. Through access to SRHR information on- and offline, young people, especially girls, women and LGBTQIA+ are empowered to make decisions about their sexuality, voice their needs and claim their rights. RNW Media provides digital media expertise to reach and engage young people in the RHRN2 implementing countries. Together with partners and changemakers, we co-create digital media solutions that are contextualised and youth-centred &#x2013; using digital media for knowledge strengthening, awareness raising and mass mobilisation for advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
